{"title":"Selene, Mother of Moths","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Selene, Mother of Moths is a named <a href=\"#/monster/moon-mother\">Mother of Moths</a> seen at level 45–59.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find Selene, Mother of Moths</h2>\n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>Inside <b>The Moonfane</b> <span class=\"muted\">· seen 8×</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"6105\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      \n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"selene-mother-of-moths\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>What it can drop</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/1d2e48e084e8ea17357b.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:6px\"><a href=\"#/item/lampwick-longsword\"><b>Lampwick</b></a> <span class=\"muted\">(unique Titanium Longsword, bound)</span>: <b>2%</b> of kills (1 in 50), <b>10%</b> from an elite (1 in 10). <span class=\"muted\">Heals you for 6% of the damage you deal. Half as strong against players.</span></li><li><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/9fa142035756a98cfeba.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:6px\"><a href=\"#/item/selenes-hush-longbow\"><b>Selene&#39;s Hush</b></a> <span class=\"muted\">(unique Shagbark Longbow, bound)</span>: <b>2%</b> of kills (1 in 50), <b>10%</b> from an elite (1 in 10). <span class=\"muted\">Critical hits stun the target for 1.5 seconds. The stun lasts half as long on players.</span></li><li><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/4b10a1b4003b700566bc.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:6px\"><a href=\"#/item/keepers-lamp-staff\"><b>The Keeper&#39;s Lamp</b></a> <span class=\"muted\">(unique Shagbark Staff, bound)</span>: <b>2%</b> of kills (1 in 50), <b>10%</b> from an elite (1 in 10). <span class=\"muted\">A kill restores 12% of your maximum mana. An attack or spell that kills several monsters restores it once.</span></li>\n      <li><b>Gear every kill:</b> a piece from its tier, excellent or better, and a second piece 1 kill in 5.</li>\n      <li><b>Gold</b> worth about 5 ordinary kills.</li>\n      <li><b>Enchanted:</b> 1 kill in 100 enchants a piece (up to 9c, and only what its material can hold).</li>\n      <li><b>Elite:</b> a boss spawns elite 1 time in 100, and an elite makes its unique 5 times as likely.</li></ul>\n      <p class=\"muted\">From the game’s rules and its own guide. See <a href=\"#/guide/unique-items\">Unique items</a>.</p>\n      <h2>Drops players have recorded</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"luna-wing\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/9dfc6bd97d5a343b2a88.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Luna Wing</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">2 drops</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"moth-silk\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/0d15d8530734f756ad4c.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Moth Silk</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">2 drops</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">2 drops</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"silverhide-arms\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/74ad12c317066662bc3e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Silverhide Arms</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+1 more\">+1 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"silverhide-head\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/d5250e2dda1660455a50.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Silverhide Head</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div></div></div>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/7c86cf4529db3a6a02f0.svg\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>Selene, Mother of Moths</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/moon-mother\">Mother of Moths</a></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>45–59</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>5,940</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>30 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}